  "mach:weightsLicense": "Health AI Developer Foundations Licence (custom, non-SPDX) — permits research and commercial use with restrictions on standalone clinical deployment without validation",
  "mach:trainingDataSummary": "De-identified chest X-rays, dermatology, ophthalmology and histopathology images; medical literature; FHIR-based EHR data; public datasets including MIMIC-CXR, SLAKE, PAD-UFES-20, TCGA, CAMELYON, PMC-OA",
  "mach:intendedUse": "Developer foundation model for building healthcare AI applications — not intended for direct clinical use without independent validation. Intended for researchers and developers accelerating health AI development.",
  "mach:aiActRiskClass": "high-risk-candidate",
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Google's most capable open-weight medical foundation model — 4B and 27B variants covering radiology, pathology, dermatology, ophthalmology and EHR/FHIR comprehension. 477k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads, 1.5k GitHub stars. Strong benchmark performance (MedQA 64.4%, MIMIC-CXR F1 88.9%). Assess rather than Adopt for two reasons: model weights use a custom Health AI Developer Foundations licence (not a standard SPDX open licence), and Google explicitly states it is not validated for direct clinical deployment. Essential reference model for any team building health AI applications; assess fit for your use case and validate independently before clinical use.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-06-01",
